    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by a \"different kind of space\"? it just feels like life is this heavy, noisy thing that i'm just not meant for. sometimes i think it would just be easier to just... stop. like, to just let go and be done with it all. does that even make sense?",
